WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.140
I'm in a hurry.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.650
Are you alright?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.739
Thank... Thank you.

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:19.989
You look so pale. Your teeth are chattering.
Are you really okay?

00:00:20.289 --> 00:00:21.750
I... I'm fine.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.870
No, no, you don't look fine at all.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.210
Here, have some water.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.509
I'm done with the orcs.

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:37.469
By the way, why did you come here alone?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.810
It's dangerous for ordinary people
to go deep into the forest without guards.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.189
Actually, I'm sort of an adventurer.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.899
Oh, yeah?

00:00:47.979 --> 00:00:50.320
It's just that the orcs seem to be the bane of my life.

00:00:50.689 --> 00:00:52.149
This is the second time.

00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:55.240
Looks like you're appealing to orcs.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.490
I wonder why.

00:00:56.859 --> 00:00:59.530
By the way, we're about the same age.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.369
Let's not use honorifics then.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.700
I'm Ruri.

00:01:02.869 --> 00:01:04.209
I'm Al Wayne.

00:01:04.709 --> 00:01:06.290
It's a pleasure meeting you, Al-kun.

00:02:38.169 --> 00:02:40.300
(The Farmer and Lulugus)
By the way, where are you going?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.009
I'm heading to Lulugus.

00:02:43.139 --> 00:02:44.930
Really? Me too!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.719
What a happy coincidence! How about going together?

00:02:46.719 --> 00:02:47.560
Are you sure?

00:02:47.639 --> 00:02:48.680
Of course!

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:51.439
You'll be in trouble if the orcs come attack you again.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.729
Eh, but...

00:02:53.189 --> 00:02:56.150
Is it okay for you to travel together with a man?

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.479
What's wrong with that?

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.699
It'll take more than one day to get to Lulugus from here.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.699
We'll have to spend the night in the wild.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.330
Oh, that.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:05.780
It's okay.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:10.659
If you dare to have designs on me,
your head will be gone by then.

00:03:12.629 --> 00:03:14.629
Just kidding, I was just joking.

00:03:14.919 --> 00:03:17.090
You don't look like that kind of person.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.509
What makes you think so?

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.379
I'm not cute. There's nothing to worry about.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.680
No, no, no, you're quite cute.

00:03:28.639 --> 00:03:30.979
Oh, yeah? I know you're being polite but it makes me happy.

00:03:31.099 --> 00:03:31.939
Thanks.

00:03:32.229 --> 00:03:34.439
I wasn't being polite.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:39.030
No, if I disagree with her, it might sound flirty instead.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.150
But if I tell her I was being polite indeed,

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.610
will she eat me alive?

00:03:44.819 --> 00:03:45.819
So horrifying.

00:03:46.409 --> 00:03:49.409
Well, we should hurry on now,
or we may come across the orcs again.

00:03:49.789 --> 00:03:50.960
You're right.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.460
Let's head to Lulugus!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.080
Yeah!

00:03:59.509 --> 00:04:02.090
I feel like monsters can pop out at any moment.

00:04:02.129 --> 00:04:04.219
Don't jinx it.

00:04:05.219 --> 00:04:06.300
Something is coming.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:18.569
It's over there.

00:04:19.149 --> 00:04:20.149
Al, I've got this.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:20.899
Hold on.

00:04:23.779 --> 00:04:24.569
Here's a letter for you.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.449
Ricks.

00:04:27.829 --> 00:04:30.079
Who is he? Should I kill him? Can I kill him?

00:04:30.329 --> 00:04:33.459
Oh, no. He's a postman. Don't kill him.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:34.709
Bummer.

00:04:35.079 --> 00:04:37.129
It took me great effort to find you.

00:04:37.329 --> 00:04:39.209
How did you come here?

00:04:39.339 --> 00:04:41.339
This is the Grim Forest where monsters dwell.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:42.509
This is my job.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.759
It's from my mom again.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:46.970
Bye.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:47.800
Thank you.

00:04:48.139 --> 00:04:49.050
An emergency?

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.930
No, actually...

00:04:55.389 --> 00:04:57.149
There are a lot of letters!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.399
I was thinking I should go to visit my parents.

00:05:01.939 --> 00:05:04.949
So, I'm heading to Lulugus, where they stay.

00:05:05.319 --> 00:05:06.319
Oh, I see.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:10.160
To buy fertilizers is my actual goal, though.

00:05:10.579 --> 00:05:12.370
Fertilizers?

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.290
To grow sweet and delicious tomado,
(*A fruit in another world)

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.250
quality fertilizers are indispensable.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.879
People in Lulugus use bittern as fertilizer.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:19.790
Don't you think it's amazing?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:22.629
I use sea water too,
but I've never thought of using bittern.

00:05:22.879 --> 00:05:24.470
As you know, the nutrients in the tomado...

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.680
I'm sorry. I'm more of a heroine.
Farming is my blind spot.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.970
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:05:29.639 --> 00:05:30.800
Where is your family?

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:31.889
Eh?

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.519
You're out alone. They must be worried about you.

00:05:35.019 --> 00:05:36.689
That's not going to happen in my family.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.649
No one will worry about me.

00:05:42.779 --> 00:05:43.860
Is that so?

00:05:46.069 --> 00:05:47.910
Let's camp out here tonight.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.160
Right, it's getting dark.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.579
What? This is so bizarre.

00:05:52.029 --> 00:05:55.949
Normally, a bag that small can't hold a tent.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.459
Oh, this?

00:05:57.579 --> 00:05:59.959
I don't know how it works,

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.920
but its interior space is a lot bigger than it looks.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.550
I'm quite dependent on it.

00:06:04.589 --> 00:06:07.879
Tell me about it. Where did you get it?

00:06:08.259 --> 00:06:11.180
It's one of my family heirlooms.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.720
Who is your ancestor?

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.769
Oh, my ancestor...

00:06:16.889 --> 00:06:19.089
(Rumble)

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:19.810
Sorry.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.689
Let's eat.

00:06:24.189 --> 00:06:25.149
Yummy!

00:06:25.399 --> 00:06:27.069
This is so good.

00:06:27.279 --> 00:06:29.360
Oh yeah? This is my specialty.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:32.699
The botato goes well with the karrot's sweetness.
(*A fruit in another world)

00:06:33.029 --> 00:06:36.000
Actually, based on the fertilizers and cultivation method,

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.079
the botato's flavor will be affected.
(A fruit in another world)

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.040
Boosting the activity of the microbes
in the soil can help improve...

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.079
A... Al-kun.

00:06:41.209 --> 00:06:43.879
I'm sorry. I just can't help it.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.459
By the way, why are you going to Lulugus?

00:06:48.089 --> 00:06:49.009
Me?

00:06:49.379 --> 00:06:52.139
I'm out here to train.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:57.139
I heard bizarre rumors about Lulugus from a merchant.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.480
Rumor?

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.230
Recently, unexplained accidents
have been happening frequently.

00:07:01.399 --> 00:07:04.060
The victims said they had seen demons.

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:05.610
The world is a frightful place.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.860
What kind of demons are they?

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.649
Any details, like the location?

00:07:09.649 --> 00:07:12.160
The problem is that none of them remember it.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.490
The guild can't take action recklessly just on some rumors.

00:07:15.779 --> 00:07:18.829
So, as an independent person, I plan to investigate it.

00:07:20.959 --> 00:07:24.879
Wouldn't that be too dangerous? Why are you doing this?

00:07:26.379 --> 00:07:31.509
Actually, I'm the hero's descendant.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.430
I see. The descendant of the hero.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:39.220
Hero? You mean the hero
who defeated Macbeth the Demon King?

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.019
Yes.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:45.689
Wow, I can't believe
I'm with the descendant of the lost hero.

00:07:46.149 --> 00:07:48.029
So, if something really happens,

00:07:48.149 --> 00:07:51.990
I'll save the situation with the power
passed down by my ancestor.

00:07:52.449 --> 00:07:54.870
This is my duty.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.910
Are you okay with that?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:57.779
Eh?

00:07:58.079 --> 00:07:59.750
You're the descendant of the hero,

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.000
but you're still a girl.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.829
If anything happens to you...

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.930
Hey, what's wrong?

00:08:19.639 --> 00:08:20.430
I'm sorry.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:24.389
This is the first time that someone is worried about me.

00:08:24.769 --> 00:08:26.060
Is that so?

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.980
I'm sorry if I offended you. Please forgive me.

00:08:30.149 --> 00:08:32.529
No, no. That's not what I mean.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.320
I'm just a bit surprised.

00:08:34.659 --> 00:08:37.990
Thank you for caring about me.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.080
OK.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:41.450
Alright!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.750
It's time to sleep.

00:08:45.039 --> 00:08:47.379
Yeah.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.169
Al-kun, are you going to sleep on the ground?

00:08:51.419 --> 00:08:55.179
Of course. I can't sleep with you.

00:08:55.379 --> 00:08:56.679
It's fine by me.

00:08:56.759 --> 00:08:57.720
If you sleep on the ground for one night,

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.970
you'll wake up with a sore neck and shoulders tomorrow.

00:09:01.559 --> 00:09:03.639
You'll suffer when you get old.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.440
You may as well sleep inside the tent.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:06.690
Besides,

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.610
I believe in you.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.570
No, no. It's inappropriate.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.779
You trust me too much.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.950
I'm confident in my instinct.

00:09:18.409 --> 00:09:19.279
Forget it.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:22.159
Here's a tip for you. There may be orcs nearby.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.039
Orcs?

00:09:25.909 --> 00:09:28.169
Well, I'll bother you then.

00:09:28.919 --> 00:09:30.250
Bedding?

00:09:30.629 --> 00:09:32.000
I don't use sleeping bags.

00:09:32.419 --> 00:09:34.009
Just sleep here.

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:37.879
There are two sets of bedding.
Why are you so well prepared?

00:09:38.139 --> 00:09:40.100
I've dreamed of having someone

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:42.759
to chat with me until I fall asleep when I'm out training.

00:09:43.059 --> 00:09:44.470
What kind of strange dream is that?

00:09:44.769 --> 00:09:47.389
Fine. In that case, I'll fulfill your dream then.

00:09:47.389 --> 00:09:48.309
Thank you.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:49.519
Well,

00:09:50.019 --> 00:09:51.399
let's have a pillow talk.

00:09:54.149 --> 00:09:56.610
What do you want to talk about?

00:09:58.029 --> 00:10:00.159
You know what, if you rub the pampkin's stem...
(A fruit in another world)

00:10:01.279 --> 00:10:02.080
Ruri?

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.289
She's already asleep.

00:10:05.289 --> 00:10:07.870
What about the pillow talk?
Don't you want to realize your dream?

00:10:12.289 --> 00:10:13.250
Good night.

00:10:27.679 --> 00:10:29.690
She just keeps moving around.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.980
Ruri, hey...

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.320
We're here!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.700
That's Lulugus.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:45.620
Yeah.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.700
By the way, why are you injured like this?

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.159
Ruri, did you sleep...

00:10:49.289 --> 00:10:50.330
I slept well.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:53.210
Is this the first time you've come to Lulugus?

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.049
I've stayed in the village all this time.

00:10:56.299 --> 00:10:59.759
I only go to the royal capital to sell vegetables.

00:10:59.799 --> 00:11:02.720
Al-kun, you're really a farmer?

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:04.049
What about being an adventurer?

00:11:04.179 --> 00:11:05.720
I've just become an adventurer recently.

00:11:05.809 --> 00:11:08.679
No wonder you would be attacked by orcs.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.059
Hire a guard, or it'll be dangerous.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.610
After all, you're a rookie.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.019
Yeah.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.529
It's your first time here. Will you be okay alone?

00:11:21.659 --> 00:11:23.320
Yeah, I'll manage.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.950
Let's say goodbye here then.

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.909
OK. Thank you for taking care of me along the way.

00:11:28.909 --> 00:11:30.120
Al-kun.

00:11:31.159 --> 00:11:34.710
It's the first time I've traveled with someone.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.919
Although it was not really a journey,

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.759
I was quite happy.

00:11:40.129 --> 00:11:40.970
Ruri.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:45.799
So, if it's possible,

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.389
can I...

00:11:49.389 --> 00:11:50.679
Can you be my guard?

00:11:50.929 --> 00:11:51.730
What?

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.350
I'll stay here for a few days

00:11:54.649 --> 00:11:56.399
and then return to the royal capital.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.860
Hence, after you get your things done,

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.740
I hope you can escort me back to the royal capital.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.279
Sure, of course.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.029
Well, I'll draw my hotel's location for you.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.409
Can you let me know after you decide the return date?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:10.950
OK, no problem.

00:12:11.289 --> 00:12:13.330
You don't have to draw it in such detail.

00:12:13.419 --> 00:12:15.580
Of course it must be detailed. I don't want you to be lost.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:16.960
You're overthinking it.

00:12:17.129 --> 00:12:18.340
Here. Take it.

00:12:18.629 --> 00:12:20.669
It's a deal. Do come to meet me.

00:12:20.669 --> 00:12:23.970
- Don't forget it. You must come by all means.
- Look at the road.

00:12:24.429 --> 00:12:25.259
Goodbye!

00:12:26.679 --> 00:12:27.759
Now,

00:12:28.389 --> 00:12:31.019
I'll go meet my parents.

00:12:32.639 --> 00:12:36.480
Demons? I've never heard of that rumor.

00:12:36.769 --> 00:12:41.279
It's a small town. If that's true,
it would have long been spread.

00:12:41.279 --> 00:12:43.779
I see. Thank you for your information.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.740
Regardless, I can't even find

00:12:47.909 --> 00:12:50.409
anyone who has seen the demons, let alone victims.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.409
Could that merchant have lied to me?

00:12:54.289 --> 00:12:55.789
It'll be great if that's a lie.

00:12:56.629 --> 00:12:58.080
Loser!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:01.169
How can you call yourself a descendant of the hero?

00:13:05.799 --> 00:13:07.549
I must investigate more carefully.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:15.980
What happened?

00:13:16.519 --> 00:13:20.690
A... A demon suddenly abducted my sister.

00:13:20.899 --> 00:13:23.570
Demon? Do you know where it ran to?

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:26.240
Yes, it headed to the Phantom Forest.

00:13:26.529 --> 00:13:28.659
Please. Please save my sister.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.950
The rumor about demons is true indeed.

00:13:32.409 --> 00:13:34.250
No worries. Leave it to me.

00:13:34.539 --> 00:13:36.409
Don't underestimate me. I'm a heroine.

00:13:40.879 --> 00:13:42.090
Here I am.

00:13:45.129 --> 00:13:47.879
I'd better ring the bell.

00:13:49.759 --> 00:13:56.230
Al!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.730
Al! Al!

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:04.399
I've waited a long time for you.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.490
I miss you so much!

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.200
Al!

00:14:08.659 --> 00:14:11.659
I'm back, Mom.

00:14:11.659 --> 00:14:13.659
Al!

00:14:13.909 --> 00:14:18.330
And so, my family visit,
which is full of ups and downs begins.

00:14:21.129 --> 00:14:24.669
My mom is proficient in various household chores.

00:14:24.919 --> 00:14:29.179
Maybe because she is gentle and lively,
she is quite popular.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:32.049
Honestly speaking, my mom is strikingly beautiful.

00:14:33.759 --> 00:14:35.889
However, nobody's perfect.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.679
She excessively cossets me.

00:14:37.929 --> 00:14:39.809
Mom...

00:14:40.269 --> 00:14:45.690
I can hardly breathe. Can you let go of me?

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:49.610
No, I haven't had enough of Al.

00:14:50.029 --> 00:14:52.529
I love you so much! My dear son!

00:14:53.279 --> 00:14:54.409
Boy...

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:58.830
What are you doing to my wife?

00:15:04.879 --> 00:15:07.259
I don't care who you are. You've really got some nerve.

00:15:07.259 --> 00:15:08.509
Darling.

00:15:09.629 --> 00:15:15.559
Do you know what you've just done?

00:15:16.259 --> 00:15:17.970
What?

00:15:18.139 --> 00:15:19.809
I saw a guy harassing you,

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.559
so I just taught him a lesson.

00:15:21.559 --> 00:15:23.769
It's me, Dad.

00:15:27.399 --> 00:15:30.200
I'm sorry for beating you, Al.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.409
We'll celebrate our reunion after I live through this.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.370
Right.

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:39.250
This woman, who loves her son dearly,
and that man, who loves his wife deeply, are my parents.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.419
Here, Al, have some more.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:46.129
I've cooked all these dishes for you.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.129
There are too many dishes.

00:15:48.419 --> 00:15:49.879
This is delicious too.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.090
Here. Say ah.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:54.590
I can eat by myself.

00:15:54.929 --> 00:15:56.509
Lucica, is this

00:15:57.009 --> 00:15:58.179
my meal?

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:02.889
- Is this black thing a roasted chicken?
- I made this as per your preference. How does it taste?

00:16:03.399 --> 00:16:04.649
- Today's dish is quite wild.
- Well, it's nice.

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:09.190
Ruri's cooking was good,
but it was still not as good as what Mom cooks.

00:16:09.399 --> 00:16:11.029
Thank you. I'm flattered.

00:16:11.279 --> 00:16:13.200
I've done my best to prepare these for you.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:17.080
By the way, who is Ruri?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.620
What's your relationship with her?
Why did you eat the food cooked by her?

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.960
Is she more than just a friend? Is she your girlfriend?

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.629
Ru... Ruri is...

00:16:25.629 --> 00:16:26.789
What?

00:16:27.129 --> 00:16:29.090
Has Al finally got a girlfriend?

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.549
Really?

00:16:30.629 --> 00:16:33.169
Just get married and have babies.

00:16:33.259 --> 00:16:34.799
Then, Lucica will...

00:16:35.549 --> 00:16:36.759
Mom's special skill,

00:16:36.889 --> 00:16:38.470
Argentine backbreaker.

00:16:38.759 --> 00:16:40.600
- Swastika Strangle, Stomach Pressing.
- Al, you're still under age.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:44.440
- Avalanche Backdrop, Reverse Cross Lock.
- You're too young for a girl to cook for you.

00:16:44.639 --> 00:16:46.440
- Mom, my dad is...
- Who is that girl?

00:16:47.019 --> 00:16:48.360
- You're even using Axe Bomber?
- How dare she contaminate my precious son's stomach

00:16:48.419 --> 00:16:48.820
without my permission?

00:16:49.269 --> 00:16:52.360
Ruri is the girl who protected me on the way here.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.779
That's all.

00:16:54.029 --> 00:16:57.820
Oh, I see. I jumped to conclusions.

00:16:58.320 --> 00:16:59.279
This is killing me.

00:16:59.279 --> 00:17:00.580
Her compulsive style

00:17:01.159 --> 00:17:03.620
- just reminds me of someone.
- Al.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:08.670
Al, were you thinking about some girl?

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:12.549
Definitely not.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.920
Come clean with me!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.130
I mean it!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.589
By the way, is that move the legendary...

00:17:18.759 --> 00:17:19.680
Al,

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.470
if it weren't for you to help ease the situation,

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.309
I would have been dead.

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:25.190
Thank you.

00:17:25.519 --> 00:17:27.190
I think you look almost dead.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:31.230
Somehow, I feel Mom's situation
has gotten a lot worse than before.

00:17:31.269 --> 00:17:32.109
Yeah.

00:17:32.279 --> 00:17:36.400
Back then, it took me great effort
to persuade her to live apart from you.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:40.160
If it weren't for you,
how could I live a happy solitary life?

00:17:40.329 --> 00:17:44.000
By the way, aren't you here for business?

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.000
I'm looking for bittern.

00:17:46.289 --> 00:17:47.789
It's said to be a good fertilizer.

00:17:48.079 --> 00:17:51.039
For bittern, there's a salt factory in the suburb.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.460
You may obtain some there.

00:17:53.589 --> 00:17:54.460
Really?

00:17:54.839 --> 00:17:57.259
Can you point it out on this map?

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.140
Let me take a look.

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.049
If this is here,

00:18:01.349 --> 00:18:03.680
then that's there. Here it is.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.269
Hey, Al.

00:18:06.559 --> 00:18:08.059
What does this mean?

00:18:08.349 --> 00:18:11.400
I told you about a girl who escorted me here.
This is the hotel where she is staying at.

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.440
When I go back, I'll need her to escort me again.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:14.859
Hotel?

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.779
Is there a hotel in this place?

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:20.240
Maybe it's newly opened, so you didn't notice it.

00:18:20.569 --> 00:18:22.329
I passed by that place yesterday.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.700
I didn't notice any hotel there.

00:18:24.079 --> 00:18:28.539
Oh, right, I heard some
unexplained accidents had happened here.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:29.789
Do you know anything about it?

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.250
Unexplained accidents?

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.880
It seems to have something to do with demons.

00:18:34.299 --> 00:18:36.710
Not that I've heard of.

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:40.589
Recently, I've never seen any demons.

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:43.599
Besides, if it's true, Lucica would have...

00:18:44.059 --> 00:18:46.599
Mom? What's wrong with her?

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:48.559
No, no. Nothing.

00:18:49.059 --> 00:18:49.940
Nothing at all.

00:18:50.269 --> 00:18:53.230
Well, aren't you going to the salt factory tomorrow?

00:18:53.359 --> 00:18:54.109
Yeah.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.029
Shouldn't you go to sleep now?

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:58.109
Yeah, it's time for bed.

00:18:58.150 --> 00:18:58.900
You're right.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.819
Well, good night.

00:19:01.359 --> 00:19:03.740
Good... Hold on, Al.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.579
That is my bed.

00:19:05.789 --> 00:19:08.660
Oh, I went to my room and took a look.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:10.539
Mom is lying on my bed.

00:19:11.119 --> 00:19:14.089
How can I fall asleep in that horrifying environment?

00:19:14.089 --> 00:19:15.839
Al!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:17.920
So, let me hide here for a while.

00:19:18.259 --> 00:19:19.089
Good night.

00:19:19.339 --> 00:19:20.509
Don't sleep!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.589
I'll get a scolding tomorrow.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.890
Al, hey! Don't sleep!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.680
Wake up! Hey! Hello?

00:19:28.599 --> 00:19:29.519
Great!

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.769
I've got the bittern!

00:19:33.519 --> 00:19:35.690
Now that my goal is accomplished,

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.980
I'll go say hi to Ruri at the hotel.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.650
Bad news! The demons came!

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.450
Demons? Seriously?

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.329
So horrifying!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.660
Are you alright?

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.750
I was attacked by a demon.

00:19:49.369 --> 00:19:51.960
While the demon was fighting a blue-haired girl,

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.039
I managed to escape.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.250
Where are they?

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:58.549
In the Phantom Forest outside the south gate.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.099
Ruri!

00:20:15.609 --> 00:20:18.109
Where are you, Ruri?

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:29.829
What happened?

00:20:29.869 --> 00:20:31.410
I don't feel I hit anything.

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:32.579
Well,

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:36.130
thank you for saving me.

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.420
You're so strong.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.509
I'm flattered.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:46.339
I love strong people the most.

00:20:50.309 --> 00:20:51.019
Ruri?!

00:20:51.269 --> 00:20:52.519
Are you alright, Al-kun?

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:53.980
What are these?

00:20:54.769 --> 00:20:56.099
Where is that woman?

00:20:56.349 --> 00:20:58.109
This is its true form.

00:20:58.269 --> 00:20:59.519
It changed into a human form and tricked you.

00:20:59.769 --> 00:21:02.279
There are a lot of demons of this type in this forest.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:04.490
There are just too many of them.

00:21:04.779 --> 00:21:07.490
Ruri, were you fighting all alone here?

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:08.490
Because

00:21:09.029 --> 00:21:11.829
this is my duty.

00:21:12.789 --> 00:21:14.619
I'm impressed.

00:21:15.539 --> 00:21:16.829
You're that man...

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.130
You're the merchant who told me about the rumor.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:22.630
Good for you, brave descendant of the hero.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.549
Or so I want to say,

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.880
but don't you find anything wrong with this?

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.509
What do you mean?

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:32.019
Nobody in the village has ever seen any demons.

00:21:32.099 --> 00:21:36.190
Why would a woman attacked by a demon
appear in front of you?

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.309
Can it be...

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.440
You've finally figured it out?

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:44.569
You're such a fool. Who can you save?

00:21:45.279 --> 00:21:47.069
You don't deserve to be a heroine.

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:40.019
(Episode 6: The Farmer and the Hero Who Can't Be a Hero)
